### 루틴 테스크 생성
POST {{url}}/api/v1/routine-task
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{access_token}}

{
  "title": "운동하기",
  "taskType": "COUNT",
  "targetValue": 10,
  "alarmOffsetMinutes": 10,
  "startDate": "2025-07-15",
  "time": "07:30",
  "byDays": ["MO", "WE", "FR"],
  "until": "2025-08-16T07:30:00"
}


### 데일리 테스크 생성
POST {{url}}/api/v1/daily-task/progress
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{access_token}}

{
  "currentValue": 1,
  "routineTaskId": 74840,
  "taskDate": "2025-08-18"
}

### 데일리 테스크 수정
POST {{url}}/api/v1/daily-task/progress
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{access_token}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "currentValue": 3,
  "routineTaskId": 74840,
  "taskDate": "2025-07-18"
}


